Moana is a adventure, comedy, family film directed by Ron Clements.

3
00:14:35,454 --> 00:14:41,454
In Ancient Polynesia, when a terrible curse incurred by Maui reaches an impetuous Chieftain's
daughter's island, she answers the Ocean's call to seek out the demigod to set things right.

4
